# Model artifacts produced during training. Only the small
# mobilenet_model.weights.h5 (~17 MB) is kept in the repo; the other two
# are regenerated locally by re-running the notebook. ResNet's file is
# over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, so it MUST stay ignored.
models/custom_model.h5
models/custom_model.keras
models/resnet_model.weights.h5
